{
  "uid": "white-label-app-v1",
  "title": "White-Label App Lifecycle",
  "description": "Operational view of the P15 white-label mobile app add-on: lifecycle transitions (day 7/30/60/90 teardown), credential access from Secret Manager, and day-90 completion rates. Metrics are emitted by marketplace-api at internal/whitelabel/metrics/metrics.go. Cardinality: no tenant_id/store_id labels — those live in the audit log.",
  "tags": ["subscription", "white-label", "lifecycle", "mark8ly"],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {"from": "now-30d", "to": "now"},
  "timezone": "",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": "Prometheus", "value": "Prometheus"},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {"title": "Subscription Health", "url": "/d/subscription-health-v1", "type": "link", "icon": "external link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Arbitrage Operations", "url": "/d/arbitrage-ops-v1", "type": "link", "icon": "external link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Runbook — credential access", "url": "https://github.com/tesserix/mark8ly/blob/main/docs/runbooks/white-label-app-credential-access.md", "type": "link", "icon": "doc", "targetBlank": true},
    {"title": "Runbook — lifecycle", "url": "https://github.com/tesserix/mark8ly/blob/main/docs/runbooks/white-label-app-lifecycle.md", "type": "link", "icon": "doc", "targetBlank": true}
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Overview",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Spec §13.5 teardown cadence\n\n- **Day 7** — banner-only tick (no state change)\n- **Day 30** — block downloads (Apple ASC + Google Play)\n- **Day 60** — pull apps + archive Firebase\n- **Day 90** — delete Firebase + purge all four Secret Manager credentials (terminal)\n\nCron runs daily at 05:00 UTC (`WHITE_LABEL_LIFECYCLE_CRON`). Alerts in `white-label-app-rules` fire on sustained zero-transitions, credential access spikes, and day-90 completions."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Lifecycle transitions — 1h rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Summed rate(white_label_app_lifecycle_transition_total[1h]). Flat for 48h trips WhiteLabelLifecycleQuietFor48h.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "white_label_app:lifecycle_transitions:rate1h",
          "legendFormat": "transitions/hr"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10},
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Transitions by destination status (1d increase)",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "description": "Count of transitions by their `to` status over the last 24h. downloads_blocked = day-30, pulled = day-60, credentials_purged = day-90.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "white_label_app:downloads_blocked:rate1d",
          "legendFormat": "downloads_blocked"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "white_label_app:pulled:rate1d",
          "legendFormat": "pulled"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "white_label_app:credentials_purged:rate1d",
          "legendFormat": "credentials_purged (day-90)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "lcd",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]},
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Credential access — 1h rate by type",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "white_label_app:credential_accessed:rate1h per CredType. Sustained 3× median trips WhiteLabelCredentialAccessSpike (security-labelled, §18.9).",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "white_label_app:credential_accessed:rate1h",
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5},
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "right"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Credential access — 24h median baseline",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Reference baseline for the spike-detection alert. When the live rate on panel 4 exceeds 3× this line sustained 10m, the alert fires.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "white_label_app:credential_accessed:median24h",
          "legendFormat": "{{type}} (24h median)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "lineStyle": {"dash": [10, 10]}},
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "right"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Day-90 completions (cumulative, 30d)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Total credentials_purged transitions over the last 30d. Each one is a merchant whose add-on has fully torn down.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(white_label_app_lifecycle_transition_total{to=\"credentials_purged\"}[30d]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short"}},
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]},
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Credential reads total (all types, 7d)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Total reads across all four CredType values over last 7d. Cross-reference with audit log app_credential.read events for actor breakdown.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 20, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(white_label_app_credential_accessed_total[7d]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short"}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "value"}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Active teardowns in flight",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 20, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "#### Query for live count\n\n```sql\nSELECT status, COUNT(*)\nFROM white_label_app_state\nWHERE status != 'credentials_purged'\nGROUP BY status;\n```\n\n_No Prometheus gauge yet — advancer reads DB on tick only, doesn't publish a queue depth. Consider adding one if backlog concerns grow._"
      }
    }
  ]
}
